WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:00.700
[soft music]

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.703
[faint grunting]

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:15.682
[lion growls]

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:17.217
NARRATOR: Tata is ready.

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:27.761
Lured by the promise of water,
the heavyweights arrive.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:36.836
[grunting]

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:43.276
Enormous beasts with enormous
thirst and enormous horns.

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:51.251
[lion growls]

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.153
Tata can't take them on alone.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.491
She won't have to.

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:06.299
The teams are primed and ready.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:09.436
[music intensifies]

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:16.810
Time to see what
the boys can do.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.782
[buffalo lowing]

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:41.868
Under Tata's guidance,
the teams isolate a pair

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:47.807
of buffalo, female and calf.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:48.608
Perfect.

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:14.400
[music intensifies]

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.604
The teacher creates
a distraction--

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:24.544
[buffalo lowing]

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:28.882
--while her students go in
for the mother of all prizes.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:48.301
A banquet for a hungry pride.

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:49.736
[lion growls]

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:53.773
The teams finally
show their true worth.

